From f1da9905df32fd058ae6ad4255bc8c49e77a8093 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SovereignOS Build <build@sovereignos.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:09:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sovereignos: skip the re-armed bouncer and active-dismiss on
 an authorized switch

Squash of former patches:

- 0058 sovereignos: split the decoy switch authorization into two single-use grants
- 0059 sovereignos: expose the decoy switch bouncer-skip authorization to SystemUI
- 0060 test: add coverage for skipping the re-armed bouncer on an authorized decoy switch
- 0061 sovereignos: skip the re-armed bouncer for an authorized decoy switch
- 0062 test: pass UserManager mock to QuickAccessWalletTile constructor
- 0063 fix: fail closed on SecurityException in bouncer-skip authorization check
- 0064 test: add coverage for the third (active-dismiss) decoy switch grant
- 0065 sovereignos: split the decoy switch authorization into three single-use grants
- 0066 sovereignos: expose the decoy switch active-dismiss authorization to SystemUI
- 0067 test: add coverage for the active-dismiss grant in the bouncer pre-check
- 0068 sovereignos: finish keyguard without re-authentication for an authorized decoy switch
- 0069 test: add coverage for intervening-switch invalidation of decoy grants
- 0070 sovereignos: invalidate decoy switch grants on an intervening switch
